# ORIGINA Laravel

Read `AGENTS.md` first; it is the repository authority for agents.

Current scope: public frontend parity with `PHENOMVALENCE/origina-next`. Preserve approved UI/UX, copy and local assets. Do not add database, auth, APIs, commerce, payments, admin persistence or integrations unless the owner explicitly expands scope.

Use Blade components, semantic HTML, project design tokens, progressive enhancement, WCAG 2.2 AA practices and small Conventional Commits.

All Git authorship and implementation credit belongs to the human project owner. Never add AI/agent authorship, co-author trailers, generated-by markers, signatures or credits. If the active tool cannot commit through the owner's identity, do not commit.

Update the relevant documentation whenever implementation changes scope, architecture, security, design rules or frontend-parity status.
